WEBVTT

00:05:30.121 --> 00:05:32.663
13 percent reported losing their job.

00:05:33.121 --> 00:05:36.121
But let's get into the nuance
of what you told me,

00:05:36.121 --> 00:05:39.371
because that's pretty illuminating
of those listeners who took

00:05:39.371 --> 00:05:42.996
the Zig-Zag Project survey,
70 percent were women.

00:05:43.163 --> 00:05:46.163
Now women are more likely
to respond to surveys.

00:05:46.163 --> 00:05:47.413
So I'll take that with a grain of salt.

00:05:47.954 --> 00:05:51.454
And on the whole, this group
has some advantages.

00:05:51.788 --> 00:05:54.454
Most of you say you've got a
college degree or higher.

00:05:54.829 --> 00:05:58.204
Many of you are married or have a partner.
So you've got some backup.

00:05:58.538 --> 00:06:01.038
A quarter of you say you
run your own business,